---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Mentric for Coaching Practices | Look and Operate 10x Your Size" description="Mentric gives coaching practices the infrastructure to deliver, manage and evidence coaching at scale — under your own brand. Replace the five-tool sprawl with one platform.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-hero-animated">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-[12%] w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-primary/[0.03] blur-3xl animate-float"></div>
    <div class="section-container relative py-8 md:py-12">
      <p class="category-label mb-4">For Coaching Practices</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-4xl">
        Look and operate like a firm
        <span class="text-primary">ten times your size</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg md:text-xl">
        Mentric gives boutique and growing coaching practices the same
        infrastructure as the largest firms &mdash; your brand, your coaches,
        one platform for delivery, management and sponsor-ready evidence.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-4">
        <a href="/demo" class="btn-primary-lg">Book a Conversation</a>
        <a href="/features" class="btn-secondary px-8 py-4 text-base rounded-2xl">
          Explore Features
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pain Points -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-8 md:py-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">The Reality</p>
        <h2>Sound familiar?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
          You've built a great practice. But the back-office hasn't kept up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="card-editorial p-8 border-l-2 border-l-primary/30">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Five tools, zero integration</h4>
          <p class="text-base text-muted">
            Your coaches run sessions on Zoom, take notes in Word, schedule
            via Outlook, track goals in spreadsheets and send surveys from
            yet another tool. Nothing joins up.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-editorial p-8 border-l-2 border-l-primary/30">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Sponsors want evidence you can't produce</h4>
          <p class="text-base text-muted">
            When the client asks &ldquo;what did we get for our money?&rdquo;
            you're pulling data from five places to build a report manually.
            It takes days and still feels anecdotal.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-editorial p-8 border-l-2 border-l-primary/30">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Inconsistent delivery across associates</h4>
          <p class="text-base text-muted">
            Every associate coach does things slightly differently. Without
            shared processes and tooling, the client experience varies from
            one coach to the next.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-editorial p-8 border-l-2 border-l-primary/30">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">You look smaller than you are</h4>
          <p class="text-base text-muted">
            Your coaching is world-class, but the fragmented tool stack
            makes your practice feel cobbled together. Clients notice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How Mentric Helps -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-8 md:py-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">The Solution</p>
        <h2>One platform for your entire practice</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
          Mentric replaces the tool sprawl with infrastructure purpose-built
          for coaching practices. Your brand. Your coaches. Your rules.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 1: Brand -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Your Brand</p>
          <h3>White-label the entire experience</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Your clients see your logo, your colours, your fonts. Each client
            engagement can carry its own branding. When a coachee logs in,
            they see your practice &mdash; not a third-party tool.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/settings-branding.webp" alt="Per-client branding settings with logo, colours and font configuration" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Associate Network -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div class="order-2 md:order-1 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/coachees.webp" alt="Coach management view with role-based access and caseload monitoring" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Your Coaches</p>
          <h3>Manage your associate network</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Invite associates with role-based access. Monitor caseloads,
            track activity and ensure consistent delivery across your
            entire coaching team &mdash; without micromanaging.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Programmes -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Programmes</p>
          <h3>Structure coaching engagements properly</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Create programmes with coach assignments, coachee enrolment
            (individual or bulk CSV import), programme-level settings
            and structured plans with checkpoints &mdash; all from one
            dashboard, not a spreadsheet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/programmes.webp" alt="Programme management with coach assignments and coachee enrolment" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Sponsor Evidence -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div class="order-2 md:order-1 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/analytics.webp" alt="Programme analytics dashboard with engagement trends and outcome reporting" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Sponsor Evidence</p>
          <h3>Answer &ldquo;what did we get?&rdquo; in seconds</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Programme-level dashboards show goal progress, session completion,
            engagement trends and outcome reports. When the sponsor asks,
            you have the answer ready &mdash; not a two-day data scramble.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: Governance -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Governance</p>
          <h3>Standardise without restricting</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Set practice-wide coaching rules &mdash; goal ownership, journey
            stages, booking permissions &mdash; while still allowing
            programme-level overrides where flexibility is needed. Share
            competency frameworks and maintain a survey template library
            that every coach can draw from.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/command-center.webp" alt="Practice-wide coaching settings and governance configuration" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Multi-Client -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20" data-reveal>
        <div class="order-2 md:order-1 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/programmes.webp" alt="Multi-client dashboard with separate branding per client" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Multi-Client</p>
          <h3>Separate clients, unified practice</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Each client gets their own branded workspace with separate
            coaches, coachees, settings and reporting. You see everything
            from a single practice-level view. Clean separation, total
            oversight.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 7: Enterprise-Ready -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="category-label mb-3">Enterprise-Ready</p>
          <h3>Security and scale built in</h3>
          <p class="mt-4">
            WCAG AA/AAA accessible, GDPR compliant, real-time collaboration,
            and built to scale comfortably to hundreds of coaches and
            thousands of coachees. Your FTSE 250 client's procurement
            team will approve it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img src="/images/cpd.webp" alt="Compliance and security features including CPD tracking and audit logs" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-editorial-lg border border-border" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Social proof / aspiration -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-8 md:py-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-8">
          <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light italic leading-relaxed text-ink">
            "A four-person practice should be able to present to a client
            and look like a forty-person firm. That's what Mentric
            makes possible."
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
            - The Mentric team
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="bg-plum-gradient">
    <div class="section-container py-8 md:py-12 text-center" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="text-white max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Ready to give your practice the infrastructure it deserves?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-primary-200 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Book a conversation and we'll show you how Mentric works for
        practices like yours.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a href="/demo" class="btn-accent px-8 py-4 text-base rounded-2xl">
          Book a Conversation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
